## What the package holds

- `dist/svgs/<name>.svg`: one optimized file per icon
- `dist/web/{{ name }}.css` and `dist/web/{{ name }}.min.css`: the stylesheet of the icon font, with one class per icon
- `dist/web/{{ name }}.scss`: the same stylesheet for Sass, with the folder of the font and the map of the icons as variables
- {{# each formats }}`dist/web/{{ ../name }}.{{ this }}`{{# unless @last }}, {{/ unless }}{{/ each }}: the icon font, which the stylesheets load from their own folder
- `dist/web/{{ name }}.svg`: the SVG sprite, one `<symbol>` per icon with the name of the icon as its `id`
- `dist/web/{{ name }}.json`: the code point of each icon in the font, by name
- `dist/icons.json`: the index of the set: its font name, class prefix, frame and styles, and each icon with its code point and its style
